{"id":"b01b13e1ea3167d2","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-clt.md","title":"Central Limit Theorem","display":"thm-clt — Central Limit Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-clt","aliases":["58-thm-clt"],"display":"thm-clt — Central Limit Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-gaussian.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-iid.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob3-convergence-in-distribution.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-clt"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-clt</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-clt — Central Limit Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c96eb70b5fd08810\" href=\"?note=c96eb70b5fd08810\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-gaussian.md\">../batch07/58-df-gaussian.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64b5bf078722d744\" href=\"?note=64b5bf078722d744\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-iid.md\">../batch07/58-df-iid.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b961383f1e02dd7e\" href=\"?note=b961383f1e02dd7e\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob3-convergence-in-distribution.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob3-convergence-in-distribution.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md\">../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\nu,m,s,Z,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(X,\\nu,m,s,Z,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IID}_S(X,\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\nu;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\">\\(\\mathrm{IID}_S(X,\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\nu;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X(n))_{n\\geq1}\">\\((X(n))_{n\\geq1}\\)</span> 是共同分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 的独立同分布实随机变量（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"64b5bf078722d744\" href=\"?note=64b5bf078722d744\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-iid.md\">../batch07/58-df-iid.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(z,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(z,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> 是带概率空间参数的期望值谓词（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3ConvergenceInDistribution}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3ConvergenceInDistribution}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> 是拓扑、Borel 结构与概率空间完全显式的依分布收敛谓词（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b961383f1e02dd7e\" href=\"?note=b961383f1e02dd7e\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob3-convergence-in-distribution.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob3-convergence-in-distribution.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polish}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Polish}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 分别是 Polish 空间和概率空间谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 是集合函数谓词（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> 是实数的标准 Polish 拓扑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)=\\sigma(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)=\\sigma(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&gt;0\">\\(s&gt;0\\)</span> 分别编码共同均值与标准差；方差通过中心平方随机变量的期望 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^2\">\\(s^2\\)</span> 表示</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}clt}\\vdash{}&amp;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\mathrm{Polish}_S(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)=\\sigma(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{IID}_S(X,\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\nu;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\n\\land m\\in\\mathbb R\\land s\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(m,X(1);\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists W\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(W,\\Omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\forall u\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(W(u)=(X(1)(u)-m)^2\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(s^2,W;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Gaussian}_S(Z;0,1;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists S,\\vec Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(S,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land S(0)=\\{\\langle u,0\\rangle:u\\in\\Omega\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall u\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(S(n+1)(u)=S(n)(u)+X(n+1)(u)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec Y,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\vec Y(0)=Z\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall u\\in\\Omega\\;\n\\left(\\vec Y(n)(u)=\\frac{S(n)(u)-n\\cdot m}{s\\sqrt n}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3ConvergenceInDistribution}_S\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R),\\vec Y,Z)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}clt}\\vdash{}&amp;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\mathrm{Polish}_S(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)=\\sigma(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{IID}_S(X,\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\nu;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\n\\land m\\in\\mathbb R\\land s\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(m,X(1);\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists W\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(W,\\Omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\forall u\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(W(u)=(X(1)(u)-m)^2\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{ExpectedValue}_S(s^2,W;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Gaussian}_S(Z;0,1;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists S,\\vec Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(S,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land S(0)=\\{\\langle u,0\\rangle:u\\in\\Omega\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall u\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(S(n+1)(u)=S(n)(u)+X(n+1)(u)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec Y,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\vec Y(0)=Z\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall u\\in\\Omega\\;\n\\left(\\vec Y(n)(u)=\\frac{S(n)(u)-n\\cdot m}{s\\sqrt n}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3ConvergenceInDistribution}_S\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R),\\vec Y,Z)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 Lindeberg–Lévy 中心极限定理；有限且非零方差是该版本不可省略的条件。</li>\n<li>This is foundational in statistics.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 递归编码偏和，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec Y(0)=Z\">\\(\\vec Y(0)=Z\\)</span> 只补齐上游收敛谓词要求的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-序列首项；从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span> 起，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec Y(n)\">\\(\\vec Y(n)\\)</span> 正是标准化偏和。</li>\n<li>原来的裸算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E\">\\(\\mathbb E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span> 与未定型收敛箭头已分别替换为期望值关系、中心平方期望和已注册的依分布收敛谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-gaussian.md","status":"resolved","id":"c96eb70b5fd08810","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-gaussian.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-iid.md","status":"resolved","id":"64b5bf078722d744","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-iid.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob3-convergence-in-distribution.md","status":"resolved","id":"b961383f1e02dd7e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob3-convergence-in-distribution.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id